<title>BELGIUM: EU sets cane syrup aid for French territories.</title>
<headline>EU sets cane syrup aid for French territories.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union's sugar management committee on Wednesday approved the regulation providing aid for cane syrup manufacture in the French overseas dependent territories, an EU official said on Thursday.</p>
<p>&quot;The committee set the aid for manufacturing 250 tonnes of cane syrup a year at 9 Ecus per 100 kg,&quot; the official said.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom 32 2 287 6800</p>
</text>
